@startuml
title ECIES Transport Encryption — Use Cases

left to right direction
skinparam actorStyle awesome

actor "Calling Application" as Caller
actor "TI Partner\n(gematik-conformant)" as Partner
actor "Smart Card\n(eGK / SMC-B / HBA)" as Card

rectangle "EncryptionService (crypto-services-lib)" {
  usecase "Encrypt document\nfor 1..N EC recipients" as UC_ENC
  usecase "Decrypt ECIES object\nby key alias" as UC_DEC
  usecase "Verify recipient\ncertificate trust" as UC_TRUST
  usecase "Audit operation" as UC_AUDIT
}

Caller --> UC_ENC
Caller --> UC_DEC
UC_ENC ..> UC_TRUST : <<include>>
UC_ENC ..> UC_AUDIT : <<include>>
UC_DEC ..> UC_AUDIT : <<include>>

UC_ENC --> Partner : produces CMS AuthEnvelopedData\n(decryptable by any recipient)
Partner --> UC_DEC : supplies ECIES object
UC_DEC --> Card : PSO:DECIPHER (card key)\nvia JCE Cipher("ELC")

note bottom of UC_DEC
  Caller names the key by alias.
  Software (P12) and card keys
  use the same JCE Cipher seam.
end note
@enduml
